---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="About Alexey Timin and the Bytes & Decisions blog"
	pubDate={new Date('May 29 2026')}
>
	<div class="about-intro">
		<img
			class="avatar"
			src="https://github.com/atimin.png?size=240"
			alt="Alexey Timin"
			width="160"
			height="160"
			loading="eager"
			decoding="async"
		/>

		<p>
			I'm Alexey Timin, a software engineer and the creator of <a href="https://www.reduct.store/"
				>ReductStore</a
			>, a time-series object store built for edge AI, robotics, computer vision, and industrial data.
		</p>
	</div>

	<p>
		Bytes & Decisions is my development journal about building ReductStore in the open. I write about
		the technical challenges, architectural decisions, engineering trade-offs, and practical lessons
		that come from turning a storage engine into a reliable product.
	</p>

	<p>
		You can find my code on <a href="https://github.com/atimin">GitHub</a> and connect with me on
		<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/atimin/">LinkedIn</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-intro {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		align-items: center;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.avatar {
		width: 160px;
		height: 160px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
	}

	.about-intro p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.about-intro {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			justify-items: center;
			text-align: center;
		}
	}
</style>
